From: Local privatebus downstream maintenance <phillmac@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] manager: keep live runtime tree untouched in manager test mode

A minimal unprivileged verification manager has no reason to create
/run/systemd. Skip all runtime-dir changes for MANAGER_IS_TEST_RUN.
Normal managers still create required directories explicitly.

diff --git a/src/core/manager.c b/src/core/manager.c
--- a/src/core/manager.c
+++ b/src/core/manager.c
@@ -2044,6 +2044,10 @@
 
         assert(m);
 
+        /* A verification/test manager must not write to the host's /run tree. */
+        if (MANAGER_IS_TEST_RUN(m))
+                return 0;
+
         _cleanup_free_ char *d = path_join(m->prefix[EXEC_DIRECTORY_RUNTIME], "systemd");
         if (!d)
                 return log_oom();
